0..75 Comment "// What forgetting a manifest carrier refuses: a model of a theory with the"
76..152 Comment "// counter\'s carrier but not its reading is no counter once forgotten, and a"
153..226 Comment "// model fixing one sort is no model fixing another (#2132). Two counters"
227..301 Comment "// whose carriers are not shared do not mix, and a counter has no sort but"
302..376 Comment "// its carrier (#2131). A pairing whose second carrier is its own does not"
377..404 Comment "// share another\'s (#2158)."
405..479 Comment "// `../../model/identity/model-counter-manifest.gandr` forgets a counter\'s"
480..555 Comment "// manifest carrier, a counter\'s manifest readings alone, and a carrier two"
556..610 Comment "// counters share, or two pairings fixing their first."
612..667 Comment "// The counter, and `observe`, which reads any counter."
668..674 Keyword "import"
675..676 StringLit "\""
676..716 StringLit "../../model/identity/model-counter.gandr"
716..717 StringLit "\""
718..719 Other ";"
